      ":question/id": "1cdb9e5f-c6d5-51ba-b72e-7c4f5a8f31db",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $AC+BC$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 4 & -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 1 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nFill in the missing entries.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AC+BC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$1$</td><td>$4$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-3$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-4}}</td><td>$-3$</td><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Keep the common factor $C$ on the right and preserve the order of the addition:\n\n$$\nAC+BC=(A+B)C.\n$$\n\nCombine corresponding entries first:\n\n$$\nA+B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse row-by-column multiplication on the shorter product $(A+B)C$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(AC+BC)_{33}&=(-1)(2)+(-1)(1)=-3 \\\\ (AC+BC)_{22}&=(-1)(-1)+(1)(3)=4 \\\\ (AC+BC)_{11}&=(1)(3)=3 \\\\ (AC+BC)_{31}&=(-1)(3)+(-1)(-3)=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n\n\n$$\nAC+BC=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -3 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n"
    }
